        "text": "144 times"
      },
      {
        "key": "E",
        "text": "720 times"
      }
    ],
    "answer": "E",
    "acceptedAnswers": null,
    "answerUnit": null,
    "solutions": [
      {
        "title": "Compare the times for one turn",
        "body": "The second hand goes round once in 1 minute. The hour hand goes round once in 12 hours $= 12 \\times 60 = 720$ minutes. So the second hand is $720$ times faster.\n\n**Answer: (E) 720 times**"
      },
      {
        "title": "Via the minute hand",
        "body": "The second hand is 60 times faster than the minute hand (1 minute vs 60 minutes per turn), and the minute hand is 12 times faster than the hour hand (1 hour vs 12 hours). Together $60 \\times 12 = 720$.\n\n**Answer: (E)**"
      }
    ],
